            </note>
            <note corresp="#d266-f2" n="88" xml:id="d266-f2-content">
                <p>José Andrés Urtecho.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d266-f3" n="89" xml:id="d266-f3-content">
                <p>Salvador Castrillo. His occupancy of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs was brief,
                    Dr. Urtecho resuming charge of the Ministry upon his removal.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
